WEBVTT

00:00:02.110 --> 00:00:06.820
On that day, like what all 
passionate soccer players yearn for,

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:11.020
we stand on the pitch of FC Barcelona's Camp Nou.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.670
There, by playing our own unique brand of soccer,

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:22.470
we surprise the whole world!

00:01:57.260 --> 00:02:00.100
What are you daydreaming about?

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:02.970
The sixth grade team, Momoyama Predators,

00:02:03.570 --> 00:02:05.470
is disbanded starting from today!

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:11.480
No way! The preliminaries are starting soon!

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:16.750
It can't be helped. You're the only one left in that team.

00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:22.660
The fifth grade team will enter the preliminaries.

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:25.520
No! I'll go find new members!

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:27.630
Sorry, but it has been decided already.

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:30.030
Manager! Please let me join the fifth graders, then.

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:32.230
That won't happen for a bench warmer like you.{You'll just be a benchwarmer, so no. }

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:34.130
Please wait!

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:40.070
I didn't do that on purpose.

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:42.170
My dribbling is terrible, I admit.

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:44.210
I never appeared in a real match, too.

00:02:44.210 --> 00:02:47.810
But what is this? I can't even practice?

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:49.280
Nice, Zach!

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:51.850
What should I do?

00:02:52.720 --> 00:02:55.050
I'm gonna dribble it up this time!

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:11.140
Wow!

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:12.640
I'm speeding up!

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:13.540
Go!

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:16.540
So fast!

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:20.150
What? You're giving up already?

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:23.180
Nope! I won't play with you if you can't steal the ball!

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:24.280
Come on!

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:27.750
Hey, you!

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:30.090
You dribble so fast!

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:32.020
That turn was quick, too!

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:33.760
Have you been playing soccer for a while?

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:35.490
Are you on a team?

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:40.700
Hey, you should introduce 
yourself first before asking anything.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.200
Sorry.

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.570
I'm Oota Shou! And you?

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:47.670
I'm Takatou Erika.

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:50.340
Takatou-san? What year are you?

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:52.540
Sixth grade this year.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:55.110
Oh? Same as me, then.

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:55.910
You pervert!

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:58.480
N-No! I'm just looking at your team name.

00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:00.390
"Dandlin"?

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:01.790
Dandelion!

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:05.390
Lion? Sounds strong!

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:09.560
You idiot! "Dandelion" as in the flower!

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:11.360
What?

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:15.530
Namba Dandelion is a famous team in Osaka!

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:17.040
So loud.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:20.040
Anyway, let me practice with you!

00:04:22.210 --> 00:04:24.610
What? You play soccer, too?

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:28.910
Yes! I was on the Momoyama Predators...

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:29.880
What?

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:30.980
It's nothing!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:34.150
No good?

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:35.290
Sure, but...

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:36.260
Really?

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:39.220
Before that, challenge Zach.

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:40.960
Zach?

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:44.030
Let me tell you this: Don't underestimate him.

00:04:48.730 --> 00:04:50.900
Go!

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.870
What are you standing there for?

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:02.950
He's telling you to come steal the ball.

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:04.350
I know!

00:05:04.350 --> 00:05:05.580
Go!

00:05:10.690 --> 00:05:12.190
Got it!

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:16.060
Ow...

00:05:16.060 --> 00:05:17.630
Why you!{You fool! }

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:19.670
Switch sides!

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:23.540
My turn now.

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:29.940
Oh no!

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:42.520
Hey!

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:44.920
He's no good.

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:47.390
I won't lose!

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:50.260
Crap!

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:52.160
Do your best, young man!

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:09.480
Isn't it time to give up?

00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:13.690
No! No way I'm doing that!{No! I'll tell you when I'm giving up! }

00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:18.420
But is he really okay?

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:21.690
Calm down... Focus on the ball.

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:24.860
Don't back down...

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:27.630
Focus!

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:47.920
Oh?

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:51.120
I did it...{Yes. }

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:54.030
I win now, right?

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:55.930
I wonder about that.

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:58.260
You only got it once.

00:06:58.260 --> 00:06:59.870
You may be right...

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:02.070
But I have the momentum now!

00:07:02.070 --> 00:07:03.440
What do you think, Zach?

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:06.200
You're asking the dog?

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:08.370
Please! Practice with me!

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:10.410
You don't need to go that far...

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:12.780
I beg of you!{Please! }

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:14.210
How serious are you?

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:17.120
Oh well. Sure.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:18.220
Really?

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:20.350
I lost to your persistence.

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:21.550
Thank you!

00:07:30.230 --> 00:07:32.660
Have you really played soccer before?

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:34.400
What do you mean by that?

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:35.930
Well, you're really bad at it.{You really suck. }

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:37.470
How blunt.

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:41.840
Are you thinking about joining a team here, Takatou-san?

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:43.710
Yep.

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:45.680
Then...

00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:46.910
Here's a direct pass!

00:07:49.980 --> 00:07:50.780
Sorry!

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:54.590
Nice.

00:07:59.590 --> 00:08:00.530
Stay, Zach!

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:07.700
Crap!

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:10.340
You really <i>are</i> bad at it.{You really do suck. }

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:15.770
It's about time for me to go home.

00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:18.010
Okay! That was fun! Thanks!

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:19.410
Later!

00:08:19.410 --> 00:08:21.010
Bye!

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:26.120
That wasn't really practice for her. I feel kinda bad. {Sorry about that. }

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:29.450
But soccer is great!

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:33.660
I can't let her go home like this! 
I need to invite her to join my team!

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:37.560
Takatou-san!

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:41.330
Hey! Erika-chan!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:44.400
Please wait. I have something to tell you.

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:46.840
What? You came to confess?

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:48.610
What are you saying!?

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:50.410
Your face is so red.

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:52.940
No!

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:56.480
You're planning on joining a team, right?

00:08:57.280 --> 00:08:58.480
Yeah.

00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:00.890
In that case, join my team!

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:04.020
Your dribbling is amazing!

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:07.060
I'm looking for teammates right now.

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:09.360
Okay? Please join!

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:11.830
No good?

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:18.140
You're really something.

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:20.910
You don't hold back at all.

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:23.840
Really? I get that a lot.

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:26.580
They say I'm loud and annoying.

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:28.980
To someone else, it looks like you're hitting on me.

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:29.880
Eh?

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:32.580
I'm glad you asked me. Thanks.

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:33.990
Then...?

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:37.090
Sorry, but I know your team's level just by looking at your play.

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:40.890
I want to join a stronger team.

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:44.360
The Predators were an amazing team.

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:46.600
I can't practice with this coach!

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:48.570
What a joke.

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:50.500
I quit this team!

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:53.000
My parents want me to start studying for entrance exams.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:56.410
This team is falling apart.

00:09:58.040 --> 00:09:59.410
Hey.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:03.250
Hey, I know it feels bad to get rejected.

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:04.880
But who's that?

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:24.070
Who's that kid?

00:10:24.070 --> 00:10:26.770
Kawahara International Heaven's Aoto-kun.

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:31.580
He was in the city semifinals last year.

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:35.380
Our team beat them 4-3.

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:36.480
I see.

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:38.650
You beat that kid's team!?

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:41.690
No, wait.  You went all the way to the city tournament!?

00:10:41.690 --> 00:10:44.390
Your team's that strong?

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:45.260
Yep.

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:48.430
Oh yeah! Let's go ask Aoto-kun and see if we can practice a bit more!

00:10:48.430 --> 00:10:50.460
H-Hey! You really don't hold back!

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:53.970
Aoto-kun!

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:56.800
Yo! It's been a while since last year's tournament.

00:10:56.800 --> 00:11:00.370
You've still got amazing technique.

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:02.310
Who're you?

00:11:02.310 --> 00:11:05.640
Huh? I'm Oota Shou from the Momoyama Predators!

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:06.910
I haven't seen you before.

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:08.410
I see...

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:10.950
Well, I was in the audience during the match.

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:14.050
Hey! Do you want to practice with us?

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:15.390
How about it?

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.320
Blue eyes!

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:22.090
There's still some time until sunset.

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:26.730
Sorry, but I'm done for today. Later.

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:30.170
No good, eh?

00:11:30.170 --> 00:11:32.170
You really <i>are</i> reckless.

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:35.440
Hey, did you really beat that boy's team?

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:36.840
Yep.

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:41.810
Hey, can I come see your team practice tomorrow?

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:45.420
Sure! Let me draw a map for you now!

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:51.090
See you tomorrow! Later!

00:11:51.090 --> 00:11:52.660
Let's go, Zach.

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:56.390
It starts at 1 PM!

00:11:56.390 --> 00:11:58.360
Later!

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:02.030
The team is disbanded!

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:08.970
No! There must be a way! I'll find a way!

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:15.910
I'm home!

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:17.950
Welcome back.

00:12:17.950 --> 00:12:18.820
Thanks for coming!

00:12:18.820 --> 00:12:20.720
Played soccer today too?

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:21.220
Yep!

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:24.890
Can you help us out? Kumi-chan's out on an errand.

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:25.590
Okay!

00:12:27.130 --> 00:12:29.290
Three orders of short ribs. Thank you for waiting.

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:30.600
Thanks.

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:31.330
Here you go.

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:32.660
Hey! Give us a beef bowl!

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:33.630
Coming right up!

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:40.670
I'm back.

00:12:40.670 --> 00:12:42.310
Welcome home.

00:12:42.310 --> 00:12:43.580
Thanks.

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:45.580
Shou, that'll do. Thank you.

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:46.410
Okay.

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:47.850
Good job.

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:50.980
Thanks. Table 2's metal netting needs changing.

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:53.150
Table 3 and Table 5 need new drinks.

00:12:53.150 --> 00:12:54.920
Ask Table 6 what they need.

00:12:57.560 --> 00:12:59.720
Your eyes are as good as ever.

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:02.030
It's nothing much. I've been doing this for a while now.

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:03.830
It's still amazing.

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:06.260
That's all he's got.

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:06.970
Suzu!

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:09.130
Oh? What's this meat for?

00:13:09.130 --> 00:13:12.440
Dinner will be a bit late today, so here you go.

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:13.200
Yes!

00:13:13.570 --> 00:13:15.470
I made some miso soup, too.

00:13:15.470 --> 00:13:16.470
Great!

00:13:16.470 --> 00:13:18.510
Leave a portion for Suzu.

00:13:18.510 --> 00:13:20.350
Okay!

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:24.680
Eat properly!

00:13:24.680 --> 00:13:26.990
I did a lot of exercise today.

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:29.390
Soccer practice?

00:13:29.390 --> 00:13:32.960
Eh? But isn't the sixth grade team disbanded?

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:35.590
Stop that!

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:37.130
Where did you hear that from?

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:38.700
The third graders.

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:41.230
Keep that a secret from Mom, okay? Okay?

00:13:41.970 --> 00:13:43.600
I think that's impossible...

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:44.470
Why?

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:46.870
I just heard it.

00:13:47.870 --> 00:13:50.040
I see. Those three too?

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:50.980
Yeah.

00:13:50.980 --> 00:13:55.250
And the rest said that they need to prepare for entrance exams.

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:57.780
All of a sudden, I was the only one left.

00:13:57.780 --> 00:13:59.020
When did this happen?

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:00.720
One month ago.

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:03.860
Why didn't you tell me sooner?

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:05.690
But this is my own problem.

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:10.060
I didn't want to worry you since 
you have the restaurant to look after.

00:14:10.760 --> 00:14:12.960
Why are you acting so tough?

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:16.130
So what are you going to do? Find a new team?

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:19.270
No, I've been playing with the Predators all this time.

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:21.570
I don't want to give that up now.

00:14:21.570 --> 00:14:24.940
I'll find new members and revive the team.

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:26.950
Right now? Isn't it a bit late?

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:28.210
Oh, shut up.

00:14:28.210 --> 00:14:29.150
Suzu.

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:30.350
Okay~

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:33.050
I finally found someone amazing today.

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:37.160
She wants to see us practice. I'll go talk with the manager.

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:40.090
I want to keep on playing soccer.

00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:44.000
Sounds good. Go for it.

00:14:47.230 --> 00:14:49.370
What? New member?

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:54.470
She's from a team in Osaka. Her skills are
 top-notch! I think she can play immediately!

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:56.170
Thank you.

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:59.740
I told you that the sixth grade team was disbanded.

00:14:59.740 --> 00:15:01.980
You can't play soccer with two people.

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:04.350
Two people? Hey! What's this about?{What are you saying? }

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:06.320
You haven't gotten any members?

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:08.790
What? You didn't tell her?

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:09.820
No...

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:12.660
That's how it is. End of story.

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:17.560
You may be pretty good, but you're a girl.

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:21.230
You don't have a coach, either.

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:23.000
Coach?

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:24.570
I see.

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:30.210
I'm sorry that I didn't tell you the truth.

00:15:30.210 --> 00:15:34.550
I didn't want to hide it from you, but I didn't want you to refuse, either.{to get rejected.}

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:37.780
Erika-chan?

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:39.780
I'm not mad at that.

00:15:39.780 --> 00:15:42.090
Well, I am, but...

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:43.190
Sorry.

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:44.960
But that old man!

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:45.920
The manager?

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:48.130
Girls can't play soccer?

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:53.100
My dribbling and finishing are on par with the boys!

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:57.070
The level of Japanese women's soccer is 
quite high! Didn't the World Cup prove that?

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:01.770
I'm so mad!

00:16:02.740 --> 00:16:03.640
Shou-kun!

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:04.480
Yes!?

00:16:05.510 --> 00:16:08.510
Practice with me today.

00:16:08.510 --> 00:16:10.880
Okay... I'll try my best.

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:23.960
Our spot's taken already.

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:27.230
But she looks amazing. Who is she?

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:29.070
Isn't that Shimizu Misaki?

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:29.800
Who's that?

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:33.300
You don't know!? She's a midfielder on the women's national team!

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:37.880
Really? But was she in the World Cup?

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:41.310
She was injured before the Cup.

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:45.880
She would have shined on the big stage. She's world class.

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:51.160
What a shame.

00:16:51.160 --> 00:16:52.460
No way!

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:54.330
Sorry for interrupting your practice.

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:55.390
That's too fast!

00:16:55.390 --> 00:16:58.300
You idiot! Know your place!

00:16:58.300 --> 00:17:00.330
You're Shimizu Misaki-san, right?

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:01.670
I have a request.

00:17:01.670 --> 00:17:02.830
Request?

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:05.040
Can you play a mini game with us-

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:06.240
You idiot!

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:08.370
I told you she was injured!

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:10.880
You're too full of yourself!

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:13.950
She's been on the national team since she was a teenager!

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:16.250
Don't just ask her right after knowing her name!

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:17.350
That uniform!

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:18.720
Ah, sorry!

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:21.720
A flower born in the wild, with a lion's heart.

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:23.990
You're a player on the Namba Dandelions, right?

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:25.420
Y-Yes.

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:26.320
I see.

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:29.030
Sure, I'll play a mini game with you.

00:17:29.030 --> 00:17:30.090
Really?

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:30.830
Yep.

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:32.160
Thank you very much!

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:33.770
But your injury...

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:35.800
I'm fine now.

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:39.570
The doctor told me I can do normal practice, too.

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:42.540
Those two trees make up the goal.

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:43.640
I see.

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:45.940
We switch sides when someone scores.

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:48.350
I see. Let's start, then.

00:17:48.350 --> 00:17:50.650
I have another request before that.

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:51.220
Huh?

00:17:51.220 --> 00:17:54.320
I want to ask you something if we score a goal against you.

00:17:54.320 --> 00:17:55.590
Hey!

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:57.060
You're quite interesting.

00:17:57.060 --> 00:17:59.720
Sure, if I'm able to.

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:01.260
I'll be serious, then.

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:03.860
Come at me with all you got, you two!

00:18:03.860 --> 00:18:04.700
Okay!

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:06.460
What a friendly person.

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:09.430
But this is a great chance.

00:18:09.430 --> 00:18:11.940
I can see how strong she is.

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:15.810
Well, we may have the advantage in a two-on-one...

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:22.910
Wow, I can't pass. Then I'll...

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:26.050
No way! She's on me in an instant! So fast!

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:27.120
Pass! Pass!

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:28.990
I can't!

00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:35.290
No way!

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:36.290
You serious?

00:18:36.290 --> 00:18:38.100
Not bad.

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:41.230
Even I understood in an instant.

00:18:41.270 --> 00:18:42.830
There!

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:45.700
This is the power of a pro.

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:47.910
Cruyff turn!

00:18:47.910 --> 00:18:48.970
Wow.

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:51.310
She's so good...

00:18:51.340 --> 00:18:53.280
So fast...

00:18:54.350 --> 00:18:55.780
So strong.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:19:01.450
This is frustrating. But I'm really happy!

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:06.460
Girls can be this awesome!

00:19:09.590 --> 00:19:12.060
I'm acting so childish.

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:13.730
O-One more time!

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:16.300
But these two are very pumped up.

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:18.400
Come at me!

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:29.510
Let's stop here.

00:19:29.510 --> 00:19:31.380
Wait.

00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:32.850
One more time.

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:07.290
Just now... this kid....

00:20:08.550 --> 00:20:09.520
Shoot!

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:23.570
We...

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:25.070
We...

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:27.070
We did it!

00:20:27.070 --> 00:20:30.940
Yes, yes, yes!

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:36.050
I feel alive again!{I'm back! }

00:20:36.050 --> 00:20:38.020
That last steal was nice.

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:40.180
I was pretty serious, too.

00:20:40.180 --> 00:20:42.290
So how did you get me?

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:44.020
I figured out your tendency.

00:20:44.020 --> 00:20:45.020
Tendency?

00:20:45.020 --> 00:20:45.560
Yes.

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:49.290
When you feint, you always start from the right.

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:53.030
So the moment you switched to the left, I got my chance.{So when you switched to the left, that was my chance.}

00:20:53.030 --> 00:20:54.600
I see.

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:56.670
Looks like I underestimated you and lost.

00:20:56.670 --> 00:20:58.800
So what did you want?

00:21:00.140 --> 00:21:02.710
Please become the coach for our team!

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:07.910
No?

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:09.450
Of course! She's a pro!

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:11.050
Think before you talk!

00:21:11.050 --> 00:21:15.550
Sorry. I'm still an active player, so I 
can't coach an elementary school team.

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:18.020
But if you have a team, you should have a coach, right?

00:21:18.020 --> 00:21:20.460
Right now, we don't.

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:25.100
We have strong players on the team, but they don't want a normal coach.

00:21:25.100 --> 00:21:30.470
That's why we need a coach that can bring them all together again!

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:33.810
I want someone like you to coach, too!

00:21:35.110 --> 00:21:37.610
Looks like you two have gone through a lot.

00:21:37.610 --> 00:21:39.540
But I can't be your coach.

00:21:40.550 --> 00:21:42.550
Don't make such faces.{Don't be so down.}

00:21:42.550 --> 00:21:44.250
You both love soccer, right?

00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:45.280
Yes!

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:46.550
Then it's all right.

00:21:46.550 --> 00:21:50.120
You'll definitely find a great coach with that spirit.

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:52.660
You don't believe me?

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:56.290
You met me by chance, right?

00:21:57.060 --> 00:22:01.300
It was just a coincidence that I came to this park to train.

00:22:01.300 --> 00:22:03.030
Just a coincidence.

00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:07.370
The soccer god wanted us to meet.

00:22:07.370 --> 00:22:10.470
I'm sure he'll find a new coach, too.

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:13.010
Be sure to gather more members.

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:15.510
As long as you don't give up on soccer.

00:22:17.280 --> 00:22:21.050
In any case, I can help you out if it's something I can do.

00:22:21.050 --> 00:22:24.590
It's to thank you two for helping me in my training.

00:22:24.590 --> 00:22:28.890
B-But I can't think of anything so suddenly.

00:22:30.860 --> 00:22:32.830
Here you go. My cell phone number.

00:22:33.930 --> 00:22:37.470
Really? Wow! This is awesome!

00:22:37.470 --> 00:22:39.900
Later!

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:42.570
Thank you very much!

00:22:43.170 --> 00:22:46.440
That's right. We can't give up!

00:22:46.440 --> 00:22:48.650
We'll revive the team!

00:22:48.650 --> 00:22:52.720
I can still do it! I can become someone like that! I will!

00:22:53.620 --> 00:22:55.250
All right!

00:22:55.250 --> 00:22:58.190
Here I go!

00:24:35.590 --> 00:24:39.220
Hello! I'm Takatou Erika, and I transferred from Osaka.

00:24:39.220 --> 00:24:41.390
What a coincidence! We're in the same school.

00:24:41.390 --> 00:24:44.360
Hey, let's go see Misaki's practice!

00:24:44.360 --> 00:24:46.960
A pro's practice session? You're 
getting too far ahead of yourself.

00:24:46.960 --> 00:24:49.130
Everyone's so good!

00:24:49.130 --> 00:24:51.240
Why are we practicing with them!?

00:24:51.240 --> 00:24:54.670
Next episode, Ginga e Kickoff!! Speed Star!
